Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:29.30,TEXT-CN,,0,0,190,,{\c&H080AFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord5}※僅代表個人感想。效果因人而異。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:29.30,TEXT-CN,,0,0,200,,{\c&H01BAFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord8\pos(345,75)}來自冒險者的感言
